  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Toss the chopped onion with a little water and roast in the oven for 20 minutes",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger to the roasted onion and stir well",
    "In a large pot, combine the roasted onion mixture, red lentils, roasted red peppers, berbere spice, binchotan charcoal powder, vegetable broth, salt, and black pepper",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat and simmer for 30 minutes",
    "Stir the stew occasionally to prevent burning",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the stew to the desired consistency",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired"
  ],
